    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "Lady Golding! Ralph! You're back, oh, wonderful!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_240"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Naughty Child",
        "text": "I'm sorry, Miss Molly."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_657_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "Oh, you scared me to death, Ralph."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Golding",
        "text": "Are all the children here, then?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_657_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "Yes, ma'am, I've counted."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "A\u2014About just now..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Golding",
        "text": "...A shell landed nearby."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "What ever for? Just who exactly is warring with who?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "It doesn't make sense. Everything was fine this morning. How could this have happened to Londinium so suddenly?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#2$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "*sob*..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#2$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Golding",
        "text": "Don't cry, Molly. No tears in front of the children."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "Yes, ma'am."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Golding",
        "text": "Hold my hand tight. At least we're all together."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#5$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "We... we have the Defense Forces, and the Steam Knights!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "They'll protect Londinium. They'll protect Victoria!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_240",
            "name2": "avg_npc_661_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Naughty Child",
        "text": "The Steam Knights..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Naughty Child",
        "text": "I think I just saw them! Are they the really tall ones, in all black and..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_240",
            "name2": "avg_npc_661_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Innocent Child",
        "text": "It was a shadow from a streetlamp, wasn't it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_240",
            "name2": "avg_npc_661_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Naughty Child",
        "text": "Liar! It was definitely one of the Steam Knights!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Naughty Child",
        "text": "Tom the cobbler always goes on about them! He says how they're the symbol of Victoria's grandness!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Naughty Child",
        "text": "'Hie over the valleys and over the rivers, rumble-ye-rumble, tell us the sound! Shalln't be thunder and shalln't be gale, the grand knights of grandest Victoria crowned!'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "I knew that song when I was little too."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "My singing teacher said that every year on the King's birthday, everyone'd gather in the Square to catch a glimpse of all the Steam Knights in formation."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_240",
            "name2": "avg_npc_661_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Naughty Child",
        "text": "Can a Steam Knight really fly?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "Apparently, all they do is run very fast, faster than any lightning or storm. With all the steam they emit on top, they must look like they're stepping on clouds."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_240",
            "name2": "avg_npc_661_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Naughty Child",
        "text": "This is pants. We don't even have a king now. I've never seen a parade once."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "Also, they told me their teacher once saw something even greater."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "It was the year Victoria had just defeated Gaul, and to celebrate the then-King's birthday, dozens of Steam Knights all returned to Londinium together."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "Their suits were draped in flags of Victoria, and once they'd all marched down the steps on the Palace of Westhaleg, it was like one giant flag all at once\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "And then, everyone heard a howl even clearer than thunder."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_240",
            "name2": "avg_npc_661_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Naughty Child",
        "text": "A howl?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "Yes, a howl. The people who were there say it was Victoria's emblem, the symbol on our flag, coming alive."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "Because ever since that day, Victoria had officially surmounted Gaul, and become the grandest nation of all Terra's lands."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Golding",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#4$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "I'm so sorry, Lady Golding! Your father was Gaulish, I forgot..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#4$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Golding",
        "text": "You needn't apologize to me, Molly. You and I, Ralph, and the hundreds of thousands of children that grew up here... all grew as Londiniers."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Golding",
        "text": "Perhaps the same goes for the one in the suit of steam armor outside."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_240",
            "name2": "avg_npc_661_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Naughty Child",
        "text": "Do you know a Steam Knight, Miss Golding?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Golding",
        "text": "...Charles Lynch."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Golding",
        "text": "He used to live in Auchterigg. Tom the cobbler was an old friend of his, hence why he loves to tell tales of His Majesty and the Steam Knights so much."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Golding",
        "text": "In fact, Lynch was the last Steam Knight His Majesty ever titled in his life."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Golding",
        "text": "And the last Steam Knight titled up till now."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
