    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "Seems like everything's the same... Where have the Duke's men gone?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "I knew it. I knew the situation would come under control lickety-split once the Steam Knights showed up!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "I just didn't think it'd be <i>this</i> fast..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Golding",
        "text": "Molly... some way or another, we're going to need to buy essentials."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Golding",
        "text": "We don't know what might happen next."
    },
