    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "Mr. Adams!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Golding",
        "text": "Excellent. For the children, knowledge is just as indispensable."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Golding",
        "text": "...Especially under present circumstances."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Golding",
        "text": "Mr. Adams, could you bring me those sets of plays from yesterday? And I'm afraid I'll need a few more too..."
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$book_close",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Golding",
        "text": "Hmm. These fairytales, along with those first steps into mathematics and physics there, and a copy of the Home Medical Guide. If you could parcel all that, please..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_657_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Molly",
        "text": "Wait, what's that noise?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_soldiersstep",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "From not far away sound uniform footsteps."
    },
    {
        "text": "They're unlike those the Londiniers have heard at parades. These are heavier, and more urgent."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Palace of Westhaleg. The Shard. Parliament Square."
    },
    {
        "text": "One flight after another in seamless succession, through Auchterigg's almost desolate streets, through the center of Londinium, Victoria's heart."
    },
    {
        "text": "As the footsteps press towards this most ordinary of streets, some of those ducked to the side of the street finally catch clear sight of the advancing army\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or better said, they see clearly the soldiers' appearances."
    },
    {
        "text": "The horns, each shape their own, all condensed in ominous black, not even the rushing yawn of daylight casting a shine on them."
    },
